span.p:
snet-apiserver (reserved)
delegated to Microsoft.ContainerService
for API Server VNet Integration – not usable on an encrypted VNet with v4+ sizes (H14)

Overlay cell: Azure CNI Overlay powered by Cilium
pods in 100.201.0.0/16 (every cell), services 100.202.0.0/16;
a pod leaving the cluster carries its zone's node address.
Pod-subnet cell (D74, az3): nodes in the same /24 slots, pods in a second address space
(a /16 of 100.64.0.0/10, a /20 per slot: snet-system-pods, snet-<zone>-pods);
classic node pools with the cluster autoscaler until NAP supports it
